Agro Transport API DocumentationA RESTful API built for managing agricultural logistics, connecting farmers, buyers, sellers, and drivers for seamless produce transportation.Table of ContentsOverview & Tech StackBase URLsUser RolesEnvironment VariablesData Models SchemaAPI EndpointsAuthentication & User ManagementTransport Requests (Farmers / Buyers / Sellers)Driver OperationsInstallation & SetupOverview & Tech StackRuntime: Node.jsLanguage: JavaScript / TypeScriptDatabase: MongoDB (via Mongoose ORM)Authentication: JSON Web Tokens (JWT) & Passwords hashed with bcryptDeployment Platform: RenderBase URLsLocal Development: http://localhost:3000Production Server: [https://agri-bpap.onrender.com](https://agri-bpap.onrender.com)User RolesThe API enforces role-based access control (RBAC). Acceptable user roles are:adminbuyerfarmersellerdriverEnvironment VariablesCreate a .env file in the root directory with the following variables:Code snippetPORT=3000
MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://<username>:<password>@cluster0.mongodb.net/agro_transport?retryWrites=true&w=majority
JWT_SECRET=your_super_secret_jwt_key
JWT_EXPIRES_IN=24h
