Transport Requests (Farmers / Buyers / Sellers)1. Create Transport RequestPosts a new logistics request for agricultural products.Endpoint: POST /api/transportsHeaders:Authorization: <JWT_TOKEN>Content-Type: application/jsonRequest Body:JSON{
  "productType": "Cassava Tubers",
  "quantity": 150,
  "pickupLocation": "Farm Block 4, Idiroko Road, Ota, Ogun State",
  "deliveryLocation": "Agro Processing Hub, Mile 12 Market, Lagos",
  "preferredPickupDate": "2026-09-10T08:00:00.000Z"
}
Response (201 Created):JSON{
  "message": "Transport request created successfully",
  "transportRequest": {
    "_id": "6a9c426ad619e21dd54c9b61",
    "productType": "Cassava Tubers",
    "quantity": 150,
    "pickupLocation": "Farm Block 4, Idiroko Road, Ota, Ogun State",
    "deliveryLocation": "Agro Processing Hub, Mile 12 Market, Lagos",
    "requestedBy": "6a9c26d79d3ac6a9ef517286",
    "preferredPickupDate": "2026-09-10T08:00:00.000Z",
    "isAccepted": false,
    "isInTransit": false,
    "isDelivered": false,
    "isDelete": false,
    "requestDate": "2026-09-05T16:25:14.820Z",
    "__v": 0
  }
}
