Installation & SetupClone the repository:Bashgit clone https://github.com/your-username/agro-transport-api.git
cd agro-transport-api
Install dependencies:Bashnpm install
Configure environment variables:Copy the example environment file and fill in your MongoDB connection details and JWT secret.Bashcp .env.example .env
Start the development server:Bashnpm run dev